  (descr "Molex CLIK-Mate 1.50mm dual-row right-angle SMT receptacle 503148-1090 (2x5, 10 circuits), mates with housing 503149-1000 / terminals 502579. Geometry from Molex's catalog drawing for series 503148 (recommended PCB pattern, re-measured at 600 dpi): 10 pads 0.55x2.70 at 0.75mm in one line at the rear, rear pad edge flush with the body rear; the line is offset 0.375mm toward circuit N (odd-circuit tails sit under the 1.5mm contact columns, even-circuit tails jog 0.75mm toward N): pad 1 at X=+3.0, pad 10 at X=-3.75. Two nail pads 1.20x4.65 at X=+/-5.30, front edge on the mating-face datum 8.75 behind the pad rear edge; body 11.8x8.75, height 9.15. Datum: body centre, mating face at +Y. Confirm the nail-to-pad-1 dimension and the 1..10 lead order against Molex SD-503148-1090 before fab. Molex top view: circuit 1 on the right, circuit N on the left.")
